## As macros/NEXT100_S1_LT.config.mac (15 bar), one photon per event, with the EL and cathode grids as nexus's
## dielectric grids (one slab of xenon each, absorbing as the mesh's transparency); no event is run
/run/verbose 0
/event/verbose 0
/tracking/verbose 0
/process/em/verbose 0
/nexus/random_seed 1
/Geometry/Next100/pressure 15. bar
/Geometry/Next100/use_dielectric_grid true
/Generator/ScintGenerator/region ACTIVE
/Generator/ScintGenerator/nphotons 1
/control/execute macros/physics/IonizationElectron.mac
/nexus/persistency/output_file @OUT@/next100_gdml_dummy
